<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine reconciliation by Codex. The three comes/from clauses retain their exact desire, dislike and ignorance occurrences. gnyis pa is omitted because Now may express its transition. First dang has no separate English word: its coordination is expressed by the list comma; second dang owns and. Whole gyis/by is a d6 instrumental, not a split final s. yin nam min/whether and zhe na/ask are d3 question constructions. thams cad and gsum gsum remain distributed and unbanked. No source correction or hgm_gloss promotion.</div>
